    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61090" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυρτο-ειδής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
		Astrol., of signs under which <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hunchbacks</i> are born, Thrasyll. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(3).100
			</span></i>, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				11.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the moon,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀμφοτέρων -ειδής,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίκυρτος</span>
			, Paul. Al.<i><span class="en">
				<u>G.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυφός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				545.35
			</span></i>.</div>
